From: Dmitry Minkovsky <dminkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 08:37:27 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Read the pane's mapping table in one statement over the
 stored audio layout

The pane built its mapping table in Rust on every read from the decoded files and the draft. One statement now joins the draft's tracks to the audio units the scan stored with the files, groups them into sides and runs, and the Rust table builder is gone; its cases run against the statement.

